<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Nouveau Paiement Encaissé</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 40px 10px;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6600 0%, #ff8c00 100%);
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #1e293b;
    }
    .highlight-card {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 25px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .amount {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #ff6600;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }
    .details-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .details-table td {
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .label {
      color: #64748b;
      font-weight: 600;
      width: 150px;
    }
    .value {
      color: #1e293b;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: right;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      background: #ff6600;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-top: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255,102,0,0.2);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>💰 NOUVEAU PAIEMENT</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p class="greeting">Bonjour {{ admin_name }},</p>
      <p>Une nouvelle opération d'encaissement a été enregistrée avec succès sur la plateforme.</p>

      <div class="highlight-card">
        <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;">MONTANT ENCAISSÉ</div>
        <div class="amount">{{ amount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} FCFA</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #22c55e; font-weight: 700;">✅ Transaction Terminée</div>
      </div>

      <table class="details-table">
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Agent</td>
          <td class="value">{{ agent_name }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Locataire</td>
          <td class="value">{{ locataire_name }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Facture</td>
          <td class="value">{{ facture_libelle }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% if mode is defined %}
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Mode</td>
          <td class="value">{{ mode }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endif %}
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Date</td>
          <td class="value">{{ date|date("d/m/Y H:i") }}</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="https://immoplus.com/admin/factures" class="btn">Consulter sur le Dashboard</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement par le système IMMO PLUS.</p>
      <p>&copy; 2026 IMMO PLUS. Tous droits réservés.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
